# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: gantt-no-invalid-tag >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-invalid-tag.md incorrect 1
Filename: gantt-no-invalid-tag-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   Design :2024-01-06, 3d
  4 |   Build :DONE, 5d
    |          ^~~~ [1]
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js does not read `DONE` as a tag here: it takes this as an item of the data.
---


